            "id": "https://curadomagazine.com/no-consiguio-acreditacion-asi-fotografio-el-mundial-desde-su-casa/",
            "url": "https://curadomagazine.com/no-consiguio-acreditacion-asi-fotografio-el-mundial-desde-su-casa/",
            "title": "No consiguió acreditación: así fotografió el mundial desde su casa",
            "summary": "Para fotografiar un mundial hay que pasar por un filtro: la acreditación. Es la que decide&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"c-article\">\n<p class=\"c-lead\">Para fotografiar un mundial hay que pasar por un filtro: la acreditación. Es la que decide quién se para detrás de la portería con un teleobjetivo de treinta mil dólares y quién se queda afuera. Florence Pernet no la consiguió.</p>\n<p>Entonces hizo lo que hicieron millones de personas durante el Mundial de México, Estados Unidos y Canadá: se sentó frente a la televisión. La diferencia es que llevó la cámara.</p>\n<div class=\"c-duo\"><img src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa.jpg\" alt=\"Rostro de un jugador en blanco y negro con la trama de la pantalla visible\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-xl.jpg 1360w\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8.jpg\" alt=\"Nombre deformado sobre camiseta azul\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-8-xl.jpg 1360w\"></div>\n<p>Lo que fotografía Pernet no es el partido. Es una decisión ajena sobre el partido. Alguien en una cabina eligió ese encuadre, ese momento, ese corte. Ella fotografía esa elección y la degrada una vez más.</p>\n<div class=\"c-quote\">«No tengo acreditación, pero tengo mi tele y mi propia visión»Florence Pernet</div>\n<p>Al publicar la serie, agregó algo que dice mucho sobre cómo entiende su propio trabajo: <em>«crédito completo a los equipos de transmisión y a los directores de la cobertura en vivo»</em>, porque sin ellos ninguna de esas imágenes existiría.</p>\n<div class=\"c-pair\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4.jpg\" alt=\"Retrato de un jugador en blanco y negro\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-4-xl.jpg 1360w\">\n<p>El resultado tiene todo lo que la fotografía deportiva profesional intenta eliminar: grano, <em>moiré</em>, colores que se van, cuerpos deshechos en movimiento. La imagen pierde dos veces, primero en la transmisión y después al volver a fotografiarla, y en esa doble pérdida aparece algo que la nitidez no da.</p>\n</div>\n<p>Porque el mundial que la mayoría vive no es el del estadio. Es este: píxeles, sala, sillón. La foto de cancha documenta el evento. Esta documenta cómo se ve el evento desde donde está casi todo el mundo.</p>\n<div class=\"c-trio\"><img src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13.jpg\" alt=\"Número de camiseta en primer plano\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-13-xl.jpg 1360w\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1.jpg\" alt=\"Vista del campo con jugadores desenfocados sobre el verde\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-1-xl.jpg 1360w\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15.jpg\" alt=\"Jugador en movimiento, imagen deshecha por el barrido\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/I-dont-have-an-accreditation-but-I-do-have-my-TV-and-my-own-vision-Full-credit-to-the-broa-15-xl.jpg 1360w\"></div>\n<p>La historia tuvo un giro. Alguien en la selección de Portugal vio la serie, y el siguiente trabajo de Pernet fue una colaboración con la cuenta oficial del equipo: las mismas texturas, la misma línea, ahora sobre los jugadores portugueses en la fase de grupos.</p>\n<div class=\"c-duo\"><img src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5.jpg\" alt=\"Jugador barrido por el movimiento, en blanco y negro\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-5-xl.jpg 1360w\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3.jpg\" alt=\"Pies de dos jugadores portugueses junto al balón\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-3-xl.jpg 1360w\"></div>\n<div class=\"c-quote\">«No siempre hay que estar dentro de las líneas para ver el juego de otra manera»Selección de Portugal</div>\n<div class=\"c-pair c-flip\">\n<p>Lo que empezó como la respuesta de alguien a quien dejaron fuera terminó siendo lo que una federación quiso para su propia imagen.</p>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2.jpg\" alt=\"Figura pequeña y desenfocada sobre el campo verde\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 1360px\" srcset=\"https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2-xs.jpg 300w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2-sm.jpg 480w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2-md.jpg 768w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://curadomagazine.com/media/posts/1/responsive/You-dont-always-need-to-be-inside-the-lines-to-see-the-beautiful-game-differently.-ItsPo-2-xl.jpg 1360w\"></div>\n<div class=\"c-credits\">Fotografías: Florence Pernet (@flo_pernet)<br>Serie con la selección de Portugal en colaboración con @portugal<br>Inspiración citada por la autora: @matthewjohnson</div>\n</div>",
